[/olist]

Changelogs

[olist]
 Added More Level 0 Variations;
 Minimum Graphics Level is now "Medium" for technical reasons;
 Lowered the crouch speed;
 Some bug fixes in Level 0;
[/olist]

Complete changes in this Update (i got no time lol)

[olist]
 Added New Post Processing Effects;
 Added New Details In Some Levels;
 Added New Headbob System;
 Changed Level 37.1 to Mall;
 Fixed the Footsteps system;
 Fixed Exposure;
 Fixed Flashlight;
 Fixed some major textures and collision bugs;
 Fixed some textures.
[/olist]

Opa, Wanderers!
After many complaints with several bugs, all have been resolved! And I'm still working on another ending... Perhaps... A good ending? An ending where John is happy, at least what's left of John...

Complete list of what changed:

[olist]
 Removed Blur Effect;
 Removed Lens Flare;
 Added New Walking Headbob;
 New Map;
 Fixed Graphics Bug;
 Fixed Strange Poster;
 More things in Level 188;
 New Interact System;
 New Pause Menu (Open with G);
 Some Levels Additions (Plants, etc);
 Steam Deck Support / Linux Support (Not Complete);
 More Control Support;


[/olist]
